  "description": "Connects the OASIS to local file system storage -- persists OASIS holons and avatar data as JSON files on disk with zero external dependencies. The simplest provider for development, testing, offline-first apps, IoT edge nodes, or embedded deployments. Part of the OASIS HOT-Swappable Provider Architecture. Ecosystem: https://oasisomniverse.one",
