  "releaseNotes": "NextGenSoftware.OASIS.API.Providers.LocalFileOASIS v2.0.5\n\nConnects the OASIS to local file system storage -- persists OASIS holons and avatar data as JSON files on disk with zero external dependencies. The simplest provider for development, testing, offline-first apps, IoT edge nodes, or embedded deployments. Part of the OASIS HOT-Swappable Provider Architecture. Ecosystem: https://oasisomniverse.one\n\nWhat's new since v2.0.4\n- feat(search): share public wallet field masks across native and file stores (4bee141)\n- Fix LocalFile profile provider keys and preserve Cosmos expansion failure evidence (0146a8c)\n- fix: complete LocalFile shared storage baseline acknowledgements (0d7477c)\n- Honor exact avatar version in local provider-key reads (0f92bb3)\n- Hydrate canonical local graphs by persisted parent relationships (4a10889)\n- Persist selected local graph nodes with canonical snapshots and replay fences (4c70ad9)\n- Prepare Development WEB4 LocalFile CQL candidate (f4469e1)\n- Preserve replicated inventory identity and deserialize LocalFile items (59d0e8f)\n- Prevent corrupt local profiles from being masked by V2 fallback (7cfa3e8)\n- Restore omitted LocalFile CQL demo and verify current controlled consumer (c4c0ae9)\n\nFull changelog\nhttps://github.com/NextGenSoftwareUK/OASIS/commits/master/Providers/Storage/NextGenSoftware.OASIS.API.Providers.LocalFileOASIS",
